Package: txtheme
Title: One Palette for pkgdown, Quarto and the Editor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Brice",
           family = "Nocenti",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "brice.nocenti@protonmail.com")
Description: A colour is decided once, in one declared grid, and every consumer
  reads it: a pkgdown site through 'template: package: txtheme', a Quarto
  document through the bundled extension, and the editor through a ready
  'textMateRules' block. Ships the generated stylesheets, pandoc '.theme' files
  and unified '_brand.yml', plus the OKLCH and APCA colour maths the palette was
  designed with.
URL: https://github.com/BriceNocenti/txtheme
BugReports: https://github.com/BriceNocenti/txtheme/issues
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
